<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f6f1" />
    <meta name="description" content="호텔 객실용품과 어메니티를 한곳에서. 대박비품이 숙박 공간에 필요한 제품을 정성껏 제안합니다." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://daorson.co.kr/" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] | 대박비품 호텔 납품 전문몰</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://images.unsplash.com" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/WebApplication1.styles.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body>
    <header class="site-header">
        <div class="announcement-bar">
            <p>보이지 않는 곳까지 정성스럽게, 호텔의 하루를 더 아름답게</p>
            <span class="announcement-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
        </div>
        <div class="utility-bar">
            <div class="header-inner utility-inner">
                <span class="utility-note">호텔·숙박업소 전문 납품몰</span>
                <div class="utility-links">
                    <a href="#about">대박비품 소개</a>
                    <a href="#categories">상품 카테고리</a>
                    <a href="https://xn--h50bz4w22pujaj7d.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">기존 쇼핑몰 방문 ↗</a>
                    <a href="#contact">고객센터</a>
                    <a href="#contact">납품 문의</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-row">
            <div class="header-inner brand-inner">
                <a class="promo-tile" href="#room-amenities" aria-label="호텔 객실 어메니티 상품 보기">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608248543803-ba4f8c70ae0b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&q=80" alt="호텔 객실용 어메니티 제품" />
                    <span>머무는 순간을 위한<br /><strong>호텔 어메니티</strong></span>
                </a>
                <a class="brand-mark" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" aria-label="대박비품 홈">
                    <span class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true">대</span>
                    <span class="brand-copy">
                        <small class="brand-tagline">호텔의 품격을 완성하는</small>
                        <strong>대박비품</strong>
                        <small class="brand-english">DAEBAK SUPPLIES · HOTEL GOODS</small>
                    </span>
                </a>
                <a class="header-contact" href="#contact"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> 납품 상담 <b>→</b></a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <nav class="category-nav" aria-label="주요 메뉴">
            <div class="header-inner nav-inner">
                <button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="category-menu" aria-label="전체 메뉴 열기">
                    <span></span><span></span><span></span>
                </button>
                <div class="category-menu" id="category-menu">
                    <a href="#categories">원텍냉장고 특가판매</a>
                    <a href="#room-amenities">객실 어메니티</a>
                    <a href="#guest-supplies">객실 비품</a>
                    <a href="#room-linen">린넨·침구</a>
                    <a href="#cleaning">청소/세제</a>
                    <a href="#categories">디지털/가전</a>
                    <a href="#categories">사무/생활</a>
                    <a href="#categories">커피·생수</a>
                    <a href="#categories">캠핑/바베큐</a>
                    <a href="#contact">호텔용구</a>
                    <a href="#contact">러비메이드</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main role="main">
        @RenderBody()
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer" id="contact">
        <div class="header-inner footer-inner">
            <a class="footer-brand" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">대박비품</a>
            <div class="footer-copy">
                <p>호텔·숙박업소에 필요한 제품을 한 곳에서 편리하게 만나보세요.</p>
                <p>납품 및 상품 문의는 편하게 연락해 주세요.</p>
                <p><a href="https://xn--h50bz4w22pujaj7d.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">기존 Cafe24 쇼핑몰 방문 ↗</a></p>
            </div>
            <a class="footer-top" href="#top" aria-label="페이지 맨 위로">↑</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">© @DateTime.Now.Year 대박비품. All rights reserved.</div>
    </footer>

    <script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
